# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Device-resident buffers of a persistent simulation on a GPU
# (D[resident-buffers]), scenario failures of Inputs/python_resident.py.
# A part that fails after parts that succeeded keeps the state at the end of
# the last of them, read between the parts or not, to the bit against a run
# that stops there; a first part that fails keeps the state it began from.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_resident.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU failures | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double: a part that fails after step {{[0-9]+}} keeps the state of that step, to the bit
# CHECK: Double: a first part that fails keeps the state it began from
# CHECK: Mixed: a part that fails after step {{[0-9]+}} keeps the state of that step, to the bit
# CHECK: Mixed: a first part that fails keeps the state it began from
# CHECK: resident failures passed
